{
  "name": "Pi-hole - DNS Health Watchdog (v6 API)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "name": "Every 10 min",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        250,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "*/10 * * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        490,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "f05376e0-4491-44fa-93d1-7bb0334123fe",
              "name": "piholeUrl",
              "value": "http://10.0.0.226",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c688f903-4f23-491e-a20c-fb7406d9c983",
              "name": "piholePassword",
              "value": "CHANGE_ME_APP_PASSWORD",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "608bdb8c-a9d9-40c3-94d8-44770ab70249",
              "name": "blockedPercentThreshold",
              "value": 60,
              "type": "number"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Pi-hole Login",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        730,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').first().json.piholeUrl }}/api/auth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ password: $('Config').first().json.piholePassword }) }}",
        "options": {
          "allowUnauthorizedCerts": true,
          "timeout": 10000
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "name": "Query Summary",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        970,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').first().json.piholeUrl }}/api/stats/summary",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "X-FTL-SID",
              "value": "={{ $('Pi-hole Login').first().json.session.sid }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "allowUnauthorizedCerts": true,
          "timeout": 10000
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "name": "Blocking Status",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1210,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').first().json.piholeUrl }}/api/dns/blocking",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "X-FTL-SID",
              "value": "={{ $('Pi-hole Login').first().json.session.sid }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "allowUnauthorizedCerts": true,
          "timeout": 10000
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "name": "Pi-hole Logout",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1450,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "DELETE",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').first().json.piholeUrl }}/api/auth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "X-FTL-SID",
              "value": "={{ $('Pi-hole Login').first().json.session.sid }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "allowUnauthorizedCerts": true,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "name": "Evaluate Health",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1690,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const cfg = $('Config').first().json;\nconst login = $('Pi-hole Login').first().json;\nconst summary = $('Query Summary').first().json;\nconst blocking = $('Blocking Status').first().json;\nconst problems = [];\nif (!login.session?.valid) problems.push('Pi-hole API unreachable or login failed');\nelse {\n  if (blocking.blocking !== 'enabled') problems.push(`Blocking is **${blocking.blocking ?? 'unknown'}**`);\n  const pct = summary.queries?.percent_blocked;\n  if (pct === undefined) problems.push('Could not read query stats');\n  else if (pct > cfg.blockedPercentThreshold) problems.push(`Blocked ${pct.toFixed(1)}% of queries (threshold ${cfg.blockedPercentThreshold}%)`);\n}\nreturn [{ json: { problems, total: summary.queries?.total, blocked: summary.queries?.blocked } }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Unhealthy?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1930,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "330c0d2b-8775-4b73-92ba-62b2e0335db0",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.problems.length }}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gt"
              },
              "rightValue": 0
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Notify Discord",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.discord",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        2170,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "webhook",
        "content": "=🚨 Pi-hole health issue:\n- {{ $json.problems.join('\\n- ') }}\nQueries today: {{ $json.total ?? 'n/a' }}, blocked: {{ $json.blocked ?? 'n/a' }}",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Note d83c",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        200,
        20
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## What it checks\n- API/FTL reachable\n- Blocking enabled\n- % of queries blocked over threshold (the old check used *cumulative daily* blocked count, which always crossed 1000 by mid-day)\n\n## Setup\n1. **Config**: `blockedPercentThreshold`.\n2. **Config**: `piholeUrl` (e.g. `http://pi.hole`), `piholePassword` (create an *app password* in Pi-hole → Settings → Web interface/API).\nTargets the **Pi-hole v6 REST API** (`/admin/api.php` from v5 no longer exists).\n3. **Notify Discord**: Discord Webhook credential.",
        "width": 2160,
        "height": 340,
        "color": 4
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Every 10 min": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Config",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Config": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Pi-hole Login",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Pi-hole Login": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Query Summary",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Query Summary": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Blocking Status",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Blocking Status": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Pi-hole Logout",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Pi-hole Logout": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Evaluate Health",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Evaluate Health": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Unhealthy?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Unhealthy?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Notify Discord",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  }
}
